    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297">

                <pb facs="0492" n="420" xml:id="pg420"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Mariscal to Señor Romero</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >City of Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-05-11"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 11,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">To Mexican Minister</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>The Senate has authorized the Executive to allow crossing of troops on conditions
                    communicated United States Government in November, 1880.</p>
                <closer><signed>MARISCAL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
